#. module: bitcoin_treasury
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bitcoin_treasury.field_bitcoin_psbt__amount_error
msgid ""
"Explains an amount or total that must be corrected before the PSBT can be "
"generated. Amounts must be nonnegative integer satoshi values, and outputs "
"must fit within the declared inputs. Individual amounts and transaction "
"totals cannot exceed 21,000,000 BTC (2,100,000,000,000,000 satoshis). Clear "
"messages do not establish that the supplied input details are correct on the"
" blockchain."
msgstr ""

#. module: bitcoin_treasury
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bitcoin_treasury.field_bitcoin_psbt_input__derivation_error
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bitcoin_treasury.field_bitcoin_psbt_output__derivation_error
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:bitcoin_treasury.field_bitcoin_psbt_wallet_line__derivation_error
msgid ""
"Explains why the selected wallet address or its signing metadata cannot be "
"derived. Possible causes include an unsupported script type, missing "
"account-key origin details, an origin path that does not match the extended "
"key, or an invalid address index. Correct the row or the wallet's key "
"settings before generating an input or wallet output. Example: an account "
"key exported at m/84'/0'/0' needs that full origin path and its master key "
"fingerprint; omitting them produces a derivation error."
msgstr ""

