"index. It is read-only because changing those choices determines the "
"address. For an input, verify that this address matches the previous output "
"you intend to spend; for a wallet output, it is the destination that will "
"receive the entered amount. Example: selecting Receiving and index 0 "
"displays the wallet's first receiving address. Deriving an address does not "
"prove that an output exists or is unspent."
msgstr ""

